00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:24.940
- I mean, those are two different topics.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:29.920
So what I do suggest, is that
you start with baby steps.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:33.580
Every routine starts with
establishing maybe one step,

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.610
