one step to the second step.

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:40.840
So, my first step would
always include drinking

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.580
a warm glass of water
with some lemon juice.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.120
And I know a lot of you guys,

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:48.930
