00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.150
every hotel has some lemon juice

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:53.600
and if they don't have
some fresh lemon juice,

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:57.130
they do have those sachets
with some lemon juice

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:00.480
and you can just pour it
in a warm glass of water,

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.980
