bottle on your hotel room,

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:08.173
you can just take a glass
of sink water, tap water.

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:11.260
Lemon water is important for you

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:13.520
because it boosts your metabolism

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:16.910
and starts your metabolism,
so it's really important

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:20.700
to start your day, not by
drinking something cold

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.410
because it actually shocks your stomach,

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:28.300
but drinking something
warm to welcome the day.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.603
- Oh I didn't know that, interesting.

00:05:29.603 --> 00:05:31.870
Okay so warm glass with lemon juice,

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.820
is there something more to it?

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:35.200
- No, actually that's it.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:39.010
And then obviously the
morning routine would include

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:42.160
