a lot of time of you.

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:07.320
So, do it in the morning,

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:11.684
and I promise you will feel
much better and refreshed.

00:06:11.684 --> 00:06:12.517
- That's interesting.

00:06:12.517 --> 00:06:13.570
Personally I have to say for me,

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.520
