00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:16.114
And I promise you, once
you establish that routine,

00:07:16.114 --> 00:07:18.300
you will feel the differences.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:19.150
- Yeah, I understand.

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:21.900
There's also all this whole
element of mindfulness,

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:24.890
right, just in the morning
not starting the day off

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:27.610
