later than you hoped for.

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:35.470
And just, is this a thing, mindfulness?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:38.660
What can you do without a big
time invested in the morning

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:41.040
to start off the day in a mindful way?

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:44.440
- I do always include a
very short meditation.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:48.170
I know it's a lot to ask of you to start,

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:51.763
to include a workout and also
that warm glass of water.

00:07:53.214 --> 00:07:54.580
- But the warm glass of
water, that's quick, right?

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:56.380
