00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:12.080
If you are interested in that body scan

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:14.973
I can link you some
interesting videos on that.

00:08:16.197 --> 00:08:18.330
- I think that's gonna do for
sure, so we're gonna then link

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.033
a few key resources that
Marie recommends below.

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.400
But interesting concept, okay good.

